# MoE FULL benchmark — CRI / Xe3p.
# Same shapes as benchmark_full.in with '_moe' dtype tags (MoE path).
# All experts active (no override_number_experts): groups == num_experts/ep_size.
#
# Per line: <dtype> --bm_name --ep_size --num_experts --topk --hidden_size
#           --new_hidden_size --num_of_tokens --verify
#   M_per_expert = num_of_tokens*topk/(num_experts/ep_size); groups = num_experts/ep_size.
# Scheduling is dtype-independent: src0 -> fp8_tensor/mxfp8/mxfp4, src1 -> bf16.
